IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTI-LORA-ROUTER-V15.

DATA DIVISION.
01 KAUTZ-DEGREE        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 KAUTZ-DIM           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 JITTER-NS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ROUTER-V15.
    IF KAUTZ-DEGREE == 0 OR KAUTZ-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 2 TO JITTER-NS.
    MOVE 45800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 KAUTZ-DEGREE.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
